        <div class="surface surface-pad" style="max-width:820px">
            <h2 class="h4">Bookings</h2>
            <p>A booking is a request until the professional accepts it. You'll get a notification when it's confirmed or declined. Requests that aren't answered before the appointment time expire automatically.</p>
            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Cancelling and rescheduling</h2>
            <p>You can cancel or move a pending or confirmed booking for free until <strong>2 hours before</strong> the appointment. After that, contact support. Each booking can be rescheduled twice, and the professional must accept the new time.</p>
            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Prices and fees</h2>
            <p>The price shown when you book is the price of the service. Materials or parts, where mentioned in the service description, are billed separately at cost. Kaarigar keeps a 10% platform fee from the professional's payment.</p>
            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Reviews</h2>
            <p>Only the customer of a completed booking can review it, once. Reviews must describe the actual service.</p>
            <h2 class="h4 mt-4">Your data</h2>
            <p>Identity documents uploaded by professionals are stored privately and are visible only to the professional and administrators.</p>
            <p class="small text-muted mt-4 mb-0">This is a university demonstration project and not a real service.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
